2 CONT Rosh Yeshiva in Sura beginning in 257. Sons: Nathan I, and Nosson. Married Hobah and was father of Rabbah who served as Rosh Yeshiva in Sura, 309-320. Rabbah died in 322
2 CONT --------------------
