2 CONT
2 CONT Spiegel, Shalom. “Le-Parashat ha-Polemos shel Pirqoy ben Baboy,” in Harry Austryn Wolfson Jubilee Volume (Jerusalem: American Academy for Jewish Research, 1965), Hebrew vol., pp. 243–274.
2 CONT
