1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abba_ben_Ammi Rav Abba ben Rav Ammi ben Samuel (Hebrew: רב אבא בר אמי בן שמואל ; c. 799 - 872) was the Gaon of Pumbedita from 869 until his death in 872.
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in about 799 to an affluent family. His grandfather, Rav Samuel ben Mar Mari was the Sura Gaon from 730-748 and a descendent of the Exilarchs.He studied under the previous Gaon, Mattithiah ha-Kohen, who appointed Rav Abba as 
2 CONC his successor in 869. Rav Abba served as the Pumbedita Gaon for two years and was succeeded by Zemah ben Paltoi
