2 CONT '''The son of Abū Saʿd, Ḥasan (Japheth), married the daughter of the Karaite nasi Hezekiah of Jerusalem''' sometime between 1040 and 1047. The Karaite linguist Abū l-Faraj Hārūn ibn al-Faraj of Jerusalem witnessed the proxy appoi
