2 CONT
2 CONT ———. “Additions to ‘Ha-Rav’,” Tarbiz 46 (1976–77): 152–153 [Hebrew].
2 CONT
2 CONT Mann, Jacob. The Jews of Egypt and in Palestine under the Fāṭimid Caliphs, 2 vols. in one, (repr. New York: Ktav, 1970).
2 CONT
