1 NAME Maṣliaḥ /ben Shlomo haKohen/ Gaon al-Damasq, Raʾīs al-Yahūd al-Fustat
2 GIVN Maṣliaḥ
2 NSFX Gaon al-Damasq, Raʾīs al-Yahūd al-Fustat
2 _MARNM ben Shlomo haKohen
2 NICK jalāl al-mulk
2 NICK raʾis al-yahūd
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
