1 NAME Abu ʾl-Ḥasan ‘Alī "Eli" /ibn Sulaymān al-Muqaddasī (Qara'im)/
2 GIVN Abu ʾl-Ḥasan ‘Alī "Eli"
2 _MARNM ibn Sulaymān al-Muqaddasī (Qara'im)
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1077
2 ADDR
3 CITY Ramla
3 CTRY Israel
