2 CONC ne.com/entries/encyclopedia-of-jews-in-the-islamic-world/ezra-ben-abraham-ben-mazhir-SIM_0007530>
2 CONT
2 CONT One letter in the Genizah (T-S 8J8.15) mentions Ezra Gaon. Ezra Gaon is also found signing a document of Shmuel b. Eli Rosh Yeshivat Baghdad in 1172. 
