2 GIVN Elḥanan
2 SURN ibn Barhūn al-Tāhertī
2 _MARNM ibn Ismail al-Tāhertī
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1038
2 ADDR
3 CITY Al-Qayrawan
3 STAE Kairouan
3 CTRY Tunisia
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1062
