2 CONT
2 CONT Gil, Moshe, and Ezra Fleischer. Yehuda ha-Levi and His Circle: 55 Geniza Documents. (Jerusalem: World Union of Jewish Studies, 2001) [Hebrew].
2 CONT
2 CONT Nir, Dalia. Yehudah Ibn-Giʾat: Monografiya (Tel Aviv: Universiṭat Tel-Aviv, 1974).
2 CONT
