2 CONC nal, 1971).
2 CONT
2 CONT Ibn Da'ud, Abraham. Sefer ha-Qabbalah: The Book of Tradition, ed. and trans. Gerson D. Cohen (Oxford: Littman Library of Jewish Civilization, 2005).
