1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://berdichevsky.tribalpages.com/family-tree/berdichevsky/1195/513/Yosef-HaLevi-Family '''Berdichevsky-Sokolka Families Tree - HaLevi, Yosef HaNassi''']
