1 NAME Gonzalo /de Lerma Polanco/
2 GIVN Gonzalo
2 _MARNM de Lerma Polanco
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1480
2 ADDR
3 CITY Burgos
3 STAE Castile and León
3 CTRY Spain
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} In his testament found here and on page 329, Gonzalo Diez de Lerma, brother of Alvaro de Lerma, calls his other brother as Alonso de Lerma Polanco and his nephew Juan de Lerma Polanco http://riubu.ubu.es/bitstream/
2 CONC 10259.4/1367/1/0211-8998_n145_p322-337.pdf. Could Francisco Martinez Polanco have married twice, one to Ines Garcia de Santa Gaeda (so far there is nobody else in any record with the surname Garcia de Santa Gaeda), and another to 
2 CONC a Polanco?
2 CONT
2 CONT Historian Juan Castellanos on page 1438 and 1449 also refers to Gonzalo Diez de Lerma's cousin Garcia de Lerma, governor of Santa Marta, as Garcia de Lerma Polanco. He also referes to Pedro de Lerma, conquistador of Peru and nephe
2 CONC w of Garcia de Lerma, as Pedro de Lerma Polanco for unknown reasons. https://books.google.se/books?id=mXYbAQAAIAAJ&dq=Pedro+de+lerma+polanco&focus=searchwithinvolume&q=polanco
2 CONT
2 CONT https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iglesia_de_San_Gil_Abad_(Burgos)#Capilla_de_Nuestra_Se%C3%B1ora_de_la_Buena_Ma%C3%B1ana_o_de_San_Gil
2 CONT
