2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/110326636/person/120078390455 Ancestry Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Aug 22 2017, 17:07:38 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Gerónimo Pacheco was a soldier who, in 1628, was reported to have taken part in pagan games at San Juan Pueblo. He denied the charges. In 1631, he declared that he was twenty-five years old.
2 CONT He wife was Francisca Cadimo, twenty. He was the fahter of Juan Pacheo and Maria Pacheco.
2 CONT María Pacheco was the mother of Roque de Madrid's wife. Another daughter was Ana, wife of Juan García Holgado.
2 CONT ~The Origins of New Mexico Families, p. 83
2 CONT Gerónimo married Francisca Cadimo, daughter of Francisco Cadimo and Unknown, about 1629.
2 CONT (Francisca Cadimo was born in 1611 in Nuevo Méjico, Nueva España and died after 1645.)
