2 CONC i.com/people/Gregorious-Gregory-Frey/5202197794320041624?through=6000000003796273463
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  HANS HEINRICH3 FREY (JORG2, MARTI1) was born Abt. 1583 in Knonau, Zurich, Switzerland, and died Bef. 1634 in Kanton Zurich, Switzerland.  He married ANNA HON July 02, 1609 in Knonau, Zurich, Switzerland.  She was born Abt. 158
2 CONC 9 in Wadenswil, Zurich, Switzerland, and died Abt. 1632.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About HANS FREY and ANNA HON:
2 CONT Marriage: July 02, 1609, Knonau, Zurich, Switzerland 	
