2 CONT
2 CONT Capt. Vicente de ZALDIVAR y Ressa 
2 CONT
2 CONT Capt. Vicente de ZALDIVAR y Ressa400 was born (date unknown). Parents: Juan Guerra de RESSA and Ana de ZALDIVAR (aka Magdalena de Mendoza). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Maria de SOSA. Children were: Maria de Zaldivar SOSA, Vicente de ZALDIVAR, Ana de ZALDIVAR, Mariana de ZALDIVAR (aka Mariana or Maria Ana de Sosa), Margarita de ZALDIVAR (aka Margarita de Sosa), Agustin de ZALDIVAR.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b248.html#P985
2 CONT
2 CONT '''====================='''
2 CONT
2 CONT (d)	Maria SOSA FARIAS m. Vicente SALDIVAR REZA, b. 1597, (son of Juan GUERRA REZA and Ana (Magdalena?) SALDIVAR MENDOZA).
2 CONT * [1]	Vicente SOSA SALDIVAR m. Ursula URRUTIA IZAGUIRRE.
2 CONT * [2]	Agustin SALDIVAR SOSA b. 1620, m. Ana DE-SALINAS.  Agustin died 7 Feb 1677, Monterrey, N.L., Mex.
2 CONT * [3]	Juan SOSA SALDIVAR m. Ana MARTINEZ HERNANDEZ, (daughter of Jose MARTINEZ and Maria HERNANDEZ DIAZ).
2 CONT * [4]	Ana SOSA SALDIVAR m. Ambrocio CEPEDA DE-LA-FUENTE.
2 CONT * [5]	Mariana SOSA SALDIVAR m. Diego GARCIA DE-QUINTANILLA, (son of Lucas GARCIA RODRIGUEZ and Juliana QUINTANILLA FARIAS).
2 CONT * [6]	Margarita SOSA SALDIVAR b. 1635, m. bet 1653 and 16, Diego AYALA TREVIÑO, b. 1618 or 1619, (son of Jose TREVIÑO QUINTANILLA and Leonor DE-AYALA VALVERDE) d. 25 Dec 1682, Monterrey, N.L., Mex.
2 CONT * [7] 	Maria SOSA SALDIVAR m. Pedro GARCIA GUERRA.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.vsalgs.org/stnemgenealogy/alonsoes.html
2 CONT
