2 CONT
2 CONT Source:Origins of New Mexico Families by Fray Angelico Chavez. Page 3.
2 CONT
2 CONT Between 1660 and 1665 he was summoned before the Inquisition in Mexico City. Charged with murder and found guilty, he was banished from New Mexico. In exile, there is no mention of this family in New Mexico. Source:Origins of New 
2 CONC Mexico Families by Fray Angelico Chavez. Page 1.
2 CONT
