2 CONC  '''su hermano Juan de Saldivar'''. Por 4 años a 60 pesos anuales. fj. (140) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Simmons, Marc.  ''The Last Conquistador: Juan de Onate and the Settling of the Far Southwest'', University of Oklahoma Press, Norman, Oklahoma, 1991, page 189.  ...  “Her son, '''Don Nicolás de Zaldívar y Onate''', who evidently i
2 CONC nherited his grandfather’s treasured title of adelantado, '''noted in his will of 1679''' that the family had fallen into great poverty.”
