1 NOTE {geni:about_me} An ancestor of this "Samuel HaLevi Abulafia" occupied a mansion in Toledo, which is still known as '''Palacio del Judío''' ("Jew's Palace"). Several synagogues were built at his expense in various parts of Castile,
2 CONC  among them a magnificent one in Toledo. This synagogue, "'''Palacios de Judeo'''" was finished in 1357, and was afterward converted into a church under the name of El Tránsito. 
