1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==brief biography and family==
2 CONT Parents:  Hans Heinrich Frey (1583 Baregg Knonau Zurich Switzerland - 1634 Baregg Knonau Zurich Switzerland) and Anna Hoehn (1589 Wadenswil Zurich Switzerland - 1632 Knonau Zurich Switzerland).
2 CONT
2 CONT One son listed  is - 
2 CONT
2 CONT Johann Jacob was born in 1648 in Baregg,Knonau,Zurich,Switzerland.  Johann Jacob's father was Gregorius Frey and his mother was Verena Oberdorfer.  His paternal grandparents were Hans Heinrich Frey and Anna Hon; his maternal grand
2 CONC father was Hans Oberdorfer and his maternal grandmother is Hans Oberdorfer.  He was an only child.  He died at the age of 57 on September 12th, 1705 in Wingen,Bas-Rhin,Alsace,France
2 CONT
2 CONT Johann Jacob and Anna Maria Schaub were married in a religious ceremony on October 21st, 1688 in Wingen,Bas-Rhin,Alsace,France.  They had a son named Johann Peter.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==comments==
2 CONT Date and place of death have also been (erroneously?) reported to be March 11, 1687 at Wingen, (now Lower Rhine), (now Great East), France <attested on his Find A Grave memorial, conflicts with what is reported here>.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==links==
2 CONT * https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/95653337/gregorius-frey
2 CONT * http://www.haydavis.com/gene/bl/default.htm?page=Frey-JohannJacob-ind2773324309.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT ==content to clean up==
2 CONT 2. Verena Oberdorfer (? ?1) was born 1610, and died 23 MAR 1681 in Wingren, Alsace, France. She married Gregorius Frey in Hausen a Albis, Kanton Zurich, Switzerland. He was born AUG 1610 in Knonau, Kanton Zurich, Switzerland, and 
2 CONC died 10 MAR 1687 in Wingren, Alsace, France.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Verena Oberdorfer and Gregorius Frey are:
2 CONT 3   i. Jacob Frey was born SEP 1638 in Hausen a Albis, Kanton Zurich, Switzerland. He married Anna Margaretha Schmidt.  
2 CONT
2 CONT 4   ii. Roudolph Frey was born 1640 in Hausen a Albis, Kanton Zurich, Switzerland, and died 3 MAY 1708. He married Barbara Gucker 24 JUN 1663.  
2 CONT
2 CONT 5   iii. Thomas Frey was born JUN 1641 in Baregg, Knonau, Kanton Zurich, Switzerland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 6   iv. Ulrich Frey was born SEP 1643 in Baregg, Knonau, Kanton Zurich, Switzerland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 7   v. Hans Frey was born JAN 1645 in Baregg, Knonau, Kanton Zurich, Switzerland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 8   vi. Verena Gregorious Frey was born APR 1646 in Baregg, Knonau, Kanton Zurich, Switzerland, and died 23 MAR 1683. She married Jacob Falck 28 JUN 1668.  
2 CONT
2 CONT + 9   vii. Johan Jacob Frey was born NOV 1648 in Baregg, Knonau, Kanton Zurich, Switzerland, and died 12 SEP 1705. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 10   viii. Melcher Frey was born MAR 1650 in Baregg, Knonau, Kanton Zurich, Switzerland, and died 27 APR 1723. He married Anna Catherine Schmidt.  
2 CONT
2 CONT 11   ix. Hans Wolfgang Frey was born 1653 in Alsace, France, and died 12 SEP 1719. He married Margaretha Schweikhkatt.  
2 CONT
