2 CONT http://www.brumm.com/genealogy/getperson.php?personID=I285&tree=Everyone
2 CONT ======================================
2 CONT  Gregorius Frey (son of Hans Heinrich Frey and Anna Hon) was born August 29, 1610 in Knonau, Zurich, Switzerland, and died March 10, 1687 in Wingen, Alsace, Bas Rhin, France. He married Verena Oberdorfer on February 07, 1638 in Ha
2 CONC usen Am Albis, Zurich, Switzerland, daughter of Hans Oberdorfer.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Gregorius Frey and Verena Oberdorfer: Marriage: February 07, 1638, Hausen Am Albis, Zurich, Switzerland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Gregorius Frey and Verena Oberdorfer are: 
2 CONT
2 CONT +Johann Jacob Frey, b. 1648, Baregg, Knonau, Zurich, Switzerland, d. September 12, 1705, Wingen, Alsace, Bas Rhin, France. http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/d/e/f/George-Defrieze-GA/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-1828.html
2 CONT =================
2 CONT 1     MARTI FREY, b. ca 1521, Knonau, Z., Switzerland.
2 CONT ...2    JORG FREY, 1554-1635, ......3   HANS HEINRICH FREY, b. ca 1587, .........4   GREGORIUS FREY, 1611-1687, .............5    JOHANN JACOB FREY, 1659-Sep. 2, 1705 m. Anna Maria Schauben,
2 CONT                     daughter of Matthias Schauben, (of Lange, deceased) on    20 October 1688 in Wingen... has some postings form Genforum  http://www.dallas.net/~mcmanus/frey.htm
2 CONT ===========================
