2 CONT ====================================
2 CONT 4.  GREGORIUS4 FREY (HANS HEINRICH3, JORG2, MARTI1) was born August 29, 1610 in Switzerland, Knonau, Zurich, Switzerland, and died March 10, 1686/87 in Wingen, Alsace, Bas-Rhin, FRANCE. Burial: March 12, 1686/87, Wingen, Alsace, F
2 CONC RANCE  He married MRS. VERONICA FREY 1633 in Wingen, Alsace Lorraine.  She was born 1612 in Of Wingen, Alsace, FRANCE, and died March 23, 1682/83 in Wingen, Bas-Rhin, FRANCE.
2 CONT Burial: March 25, 1681, Of Wingen, Alsace, FRANCE Children of GREGORIUS FREY and MRS. FREY are: 	i.	HANS JACOB5 FREY, b. September 23, 1638, Hausen, Am. Albis, Zurich, Switzerland; d. Abt. 1640, Hausen, Am. Albis, Zurich, Switzerl
2 CONC and. 	ii.	RUDOLPH FREY, b. Abt. 1640, Hausen, Am. Albis, Zurich, Switzerland; d. May 03, 1708, Wingen, FRANCE. 	iii.	THOMAS FREY, b. July 04, 1641, Knonau, Zurich, Switzerland. 	iv.	JOHANN MELCHOIR FREY, b. 1642, Knonau, Zurich, S
2 CONC witzerland; d. April 27, 1723, Wingen, Alsace Lorraine. 	v.	ULRICH FREY, b. 1643, Baregg, Knonau, Zurich, Switzerland. : Burial: March 16, 1643/44, Baregg, Knonau, Zurich, Switzerland
2 CONT
2 CONT 5.	vi.	JOHANN JACOB FREY, b. 1648, Baregg, Knonau, Zurich, Switzerland; d. September 12, 1705, Wingen, Alsace, Bas-Rhin, FRANCE. 	vii.	JOHANN WOLFGANG FREY, b. 1656, Wingen, Alsace, Bas-Rhin, FRANCE. 	viii.	HANS FREY, b. Abt. 1657
2 CONC , <Of Wingen, B-Rhin, Frnc>; d. September 12, 1719, Climbach, Bas Rhin, FRANCE. 	ix.	VERONICA FREY, b. 1661, Wingen, Alsace, Bas-Rhin, FRANCE. http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/f/l/e/Joseph-F-Fleetwood/FILE/0006text.txt
