2 CONT ===  Moved to France in 1651. /  My German ( ===
2 CONT Moved to France in 1651. /  My German (Swiss) Ancestors II by Clifford R. Canfield, page 105 - 05a.  /  Knonau, Zurich Census 1649
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT ===  (1627) ===
2 CONT (1627)
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT === Life Sketch ===
2 CONT Gregorius Frey was born in Knonau, Kanton Zurich, Switzerland in August 1610 and was christened 29 Aug 1610. He married (1) Elsbeth Ringer by whom he had one child. He married (2) Verena Oferdorfer, daughter of Hans Oberdorder at 
2 CONC Hausen a Albis, Kt Zurich. They had nine children of whom the first two, Jacob, and Rudolph were born in Hausen a Albis, Kt Zurich. The next six were born in Baregg, Knonau, Kt Zurich. In 1651 Gregarious and Verena with five child
2 CONC ren moved to Elsass (Alsace) France. (Some children were deceased). The last child was born in France. Gregarious was a carpenter by trade, and because a Justice in Wingren, Alsace where he lived until he died in 1687. Gregorius a
2 CONC nd Verena were members of the Reformed Church.
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
