1 NOTE was baptized on 22 Nov 1612 at Ottenbach Reformed Church, Kronau District, Zurich, Switzerland. He was born on 22 Nov 1612 in Ottenbach, Canton Zurich, Switzerland. He died on 1 Jul 1672 at Oberlunnern, Kronau District, Zurich, Sw
2 CONC itzerland. Thomas married the second time to Margareth Sydler and had three children: Verenli bp. 20 September 1663 d. 24 Feb 1746 at Wibzeln, Switzerland and married Lorenz Gebhard and Anna Dorothea b. 1665 d. bef 1682; Heinli bp
2 CONC . 28 Feb 1669 and died at Ransbrunn, Sw. It is suspected that Thomas was married once before marrying Anna Frey. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  Thomas GUTH and * Anna FREY were married on 8 Feb 1631 at Ottenbach Reformed Church, Kronau District, Zurich, Switzerland.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1353. * Anna FREY was born in 1615 in Hedingen, Switzerland. She died on 10 Aug 1660 at Oberlunnern, Kronau District, Zurich
