2 CONC f Saltillo, native of Navarra, was known by the nickname El Vizcaino [a reference to his Basque origins]. He '''married Dona Maria RODRIGUEZ''', daughter of Capitan Baltasar de SOSA and Dona Ines RODRIGUEZ. Their '''children were:
2 CONC ''' Beatriz, whose first marriage was to Capitan Alonso ALBORNOZ and second marriage was to Capitan Bernabe de las CASAS; Ursula, who married Capitan Diego SANCHEZ; Melchora, who married Capitan Martin SANCHEZ; Ines, who married C
2 CONC apitan Francisco MARTINEZ GUAJARDO; Maria, who married Capitan Jose de TREVINO; Francisca, who married Capitan Juan TARANCO VALLEJO; '''Martin, who married Maria ROJO de las RUELAS'''; and Mariana NAVARRO RODRIGUEZ, who married Ca
2 CONC pitan Marcos GONZALEZ HIDALGO.
