1 TITL Father of Spanish Opera
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Spanish composer and harpist who became the most influential composer of his time in the Hispanic world writing the music for the first two operas created in Spanish. He is considered by many to be the father of Sp
2 CONC anish Opera and of the Zarzuela
2 CONT
2 CONT The latest genealogy of Juan Hidalgo Polanco is found in the book https://books.google.se/books?id=B-99-TFL4iMC&pg=PR98&dq=juan+hidalgo+de+polanco+domingo+polanco&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwjcvKqa3vvcAhVRxosKHdxDBC0Q6AEILDAA#v=onepage&
2 CONC q=juan%20hidalgo%20de%20polanco%20domingo%20polanco&f=false
2 CONT
2 CONT His oldest Polanco ancestor according to the book above is Domingo de Polanco. The only Domingo de Polanco in record was born or resided in Burgos according to https://dokuklik.euskadi.eus/badator/visor/665335 and possibly the son
2 CONC  of Juan, Alonso or Andres Lopez de Polanco
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juan_Hidalgo_de_Polanco
2 CONT
