1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Cavazos Garza, Israel.  ''Catálogo y Síntesis de los Protocolos del Archivo Municipal de Monterrey 1599-1700'', Instituto Tecnologico y de Estudios Superiores de Monterrey, Monterrey, Nuevo León, México, 1966, page
2 CONC s 122-123, #393 [V, fol. 72, no. 30].  ...  This protocolo is '''the will of Luisa de las Casas''' and sets forth her instruction to be buried in "la parroquial" with various religious events, her bequests to children, and her deb
2 CONC ts.  She lists her '''deceased spouse Alonso Rodríguez''' and her children Nicolás, Bernabé, Juan, Francisco, Josefa, Magdalena, Teresa, José, Alonso, and María.  Signed Monterrey, 30 September 1692.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''________________________''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Alonso RODRIGUEZ de Carabajal896 was born (date unknown).
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Luisa de VILLARREAL (aka Luisa de las Casas). Luisa de VILLARREAL (aka Luisa de las Casas) and Alonso RODRIGUEZ de Carabajal were married. Children were: Bernabe RODRIGUEZ de Carabajal, Capt. Nicolas RODRIGUEZ, Francisco R
2 CONC ODRIGUEZ de Carabajal.
2 CONT
