2 CONT **b. 1597, (son of Juan GUERRA REZA and Ana (Magdalena?) SALDIVAR MENDOZA). 
2 CONT *daughter of  Ana SOSA NAVARRO m. 1611, Alonso FARIAS TREVIÑO
2 CONT
