1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 27. VICENTE10 DE AYALA-Y-TREVINO (FRANCISCO9 DE TREVINO, JOSEPH-DIEGO8 DE TREMINO-Y-QUINTANILLA, JOSE-DIEGO7 DE TREMINO, DIEGO6 TREMINO-DE-VELASCO, BERNARDINO5 FERNANDEZ-DE-VELASCO, FRANCISCO4, PEDRO3, JUAN2, PEDRO
2 CONC 1) He married (1) MARIA RODRIGUEZ-DE-CARVAJAL, daughter of ALONSO RODRIGUEZ-DE-CARVAJAL and LUISA VILLARREAL-DE-LAS-CASAS. She was born 1660 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. He married (2) MARIA DE MONTALVO. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of VICENTE DE AYALA-Y-TREVINO and MARIA RODRIGUEZ-DE-CARVAJAL are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. JUAN ANTONIO11 AYALA-Y-TREVINO.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. MICHAELA DE TREVINO, b. 1678; m. MANUEL-JOSEPH-JURADO RUIZ-DE-OCON, 07 Jan 1697/98, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 1675.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. CAPTAIN JOSEPH TREVINO-RODRIGUEZ, b. 03 May 1678, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. POLONIA FLORES-DE-ABREGO-DE-LA-GARZA, 10 Oct 1690, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for CAPTAIN JOSEPH TREVINO-RODRIGUEZ:
2 CONT
2 CONT A.K.A. Joseph de Abrego.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. MIGUEL TREVINO-RODRIGUEZ, b. 04 Aug 1683, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT v. MICAELA DE TREVINO-AYALA, b. 1662; m. ALFEREZ JUAN RUIZ-DE-OCON, 04 Feb 1681/82, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 1660.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of VICENTE DE AYALA-Y-TREVINO and MARIA DE MONTALVO is:
2 CONT
2 CONT vi. ALFEREZ GASPAR11 DE TREVINO-MONTALVO, b. 1660, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. JOSEFA SANCHEZ-PAZ, 31 Jul 1681, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 1663, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for ALFEREZ GASPAR DE TREVINO-MONTALVO:
