2 CONC na Montes Vigil about 1731 Santa Cruz,Santa FE NM Film#1761175 QUINTANA BOOKS Page 582 ELENA MONTES VIGIL----Her husband was Diego Gonzales born 1705 and died 12-1-1745 at Santa Cruz,the son of Diego Gonzales and Maria de Benavide
2 CONC z P.415-b)Santa Cruz Baptisms 1)Maria Ignacia Gonzales born 1734 was the second wife of Juan Antonio Duran 8-81734, Ignacia ,daughter of Diego Gonzales and Elena Vigil, sponsors:Joseph Romero and Ana Maria Herrera. 2)6-8-1743,Fran
2 CONC cisco Gonzales, son of Diego Gonzales and Elena Vigil,sponsor Nicholas Sisneros 3)10-3-1745 Miguel, son of Diego Gonzales and Elena Vigil, sponsors, Pedro Griego and Ana De Herrera. ________________________________________________
2 CONC _________ CANDELARIA PACHECO----Quintana Books --Ygnacio Pacheco was born around 1714 in Santa Cruz, the son of Felipe Pacheco and Antonia Leyva. His wife was Maria Margarita Martin born around 1722 in Santa Cruz. They were marrie
