2 CONT Johan Jacob FREY Birth  1648  Baregg,,Knonau,Zurich,SWITZERLAND,    Baptism  5 Nov 1648  Knonau,,,Zurich,SWITZERLAND,    Died  12 Sep 1705  Wingen,,Sickingen,Lower Alsace (Bas-rhine),FRANCE,    Buried  14 Sep 1705  Wingen,,Sicking
2 CONC en,Lower Alsace (Bas-rhine),FRANCE,    
2 CONT
2 CONT Family  Anna Maria SCHAUB,   b. 1665, Langensoultxbach,,,Alsace,FRANCE,    Children    
2 CONT # Johann Peter FREY,   b. 1689, Wingen,,Sickingen,Lower Alsace (Bas-rhine),FRANCE, ,   d. 1766, ,,Rowan County,North Carolina,USA,  
2 CONT # Johann Heinrich FREY,   b. 27 Jun 1693 
2 CONT # Anna Cleophe FREY,   b. 27 Apr 1697 
