2 CONT
2 CONT 5.  JOHANN JACOB5 FREY (GREGORIUS4, HANS HEINRICH3, JORG2, MARTI1) was born 1648 in Baregg, Knonau, Zurich, Switzerland, and died September 12, 1705 in Wingen, Alsace, Bas-Rhin, FRANCE.  Burial: September 15, 1705, Wingen, Alsace,
2 CONC  Bas-Rhin, FRANCE He married ANNA MARIA SCHAUB October 21, 1688 in Wingen, Bas-Rhin, FRANCE, daughter of MATTHAEUS SCHAUB and URSULA LANGE.  She was born 1665 in Langensoultzbach, Bas-Rhin, Fr, and died Aft. 1725 in Schoenau, Pfaz
2 CONC , Germany. 	 Children of JOHANN FREY and ANNA SCHAUB are: 	i.	JOHANN PETER6 FREY, b. September 27, 1689, Wingen, Alsance, FRANCE; d. May 04, 1766, Friedburg, Rowan, N C. Burial: May 06, 1766, Rowan, North Carolina 6.	ii.	JOHANN HE
2 CONC INREICH FREY, b. June 27, 1693, Wingen, Elsasz, Bas-Rhin, FRANCE; d. May 04, 1766, Friedberg, Davidson, North Carolina. 	iii.	ANNA CLEOPHE FREY, b. April 27, 1696, Wingen, Alsace, B-Rhn, Fr; d. Abt. 1773, W. Manchester Tp, YORK, P
2 CONC a. Burial: Abt. 1773, W. Manchester Tp, YORK, Pa 	iv.	ANDREAS FREY, b. November 07, 1698, Wingen, Alsace, FRANCE, FRANCE; d. Abt. 1750, Bracknoch Twp, Lancaster Co, Pa.. 	v.	MARIA BARBARA FREY, b. April 21, 1701, Wingen, Alsace, B
2 CONC as-Rhin, FRANCE; d. Infant. 	vi.	ANNA CATHARINA FREY, b. January 10, 1703/04, Wingen, Alsace, FRANCE; d. Infant.
2 CONT
