2 CONT 2. Verena Oberdorfer (? ?1) was born 1610, and died 23 MAR 1681 in Wingren, Alsace, France. She married Gregorius Frey in Hausen a Albis, Kanton Zurich, Switzerland. He was born AUG 1610 in Knonau, Kanton Zurich, Switzerland, and 
2 CONC died 10 MAR 1687 in Wingren, Alsace, France.  
