2 CONT 1. Johann Melchoir FREY (Gregorius FREY2, Johan Heinrich FREY1) was born ABT 1642 in Baregg,Knonau,Zurich,Switzerland , and died 27 Apr 1723 in Wingen, Alsace, France. He married Anna Catherine SCHMIDT. She was born 1652 in Wingen
2 CONC , Alsace, France, and died 1732.  
2 CONT      Children of Johann Melchoir FREY and Anna Catherine SCHMIDT are:
2 CONT     2   i. Maria Catharina FREY was born 1689, and died 1767. She married Johanns GUTHMILLER.  
2 CONT    + 3   ii. Anna Ursula FREYwas born 1 Jan 1687. She married Phillip BEY. He was born in Niedersteinbach, France.  
2 CONT    + 4   iii. Anna Maria Catharina FREY ABT 1698 in Wingen,Weissenburg,Alsace,France. She married Johannes GUTHMILLER 21 Nov 1719 in Wingen,Weissenburg,Alsace,France, son of Johann Heinrich GUTHMILLER and Ana Elisabeth SCHILLING. 
2 CONC He was born ABT 1691/1698 in Wingen,Weissenburg,Alsace,France.   http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=REG&db=mwalth&id=I48690
