1 NOTE  Hans Rudolph GUTH Sr. was born on 3 Dec 1645 in Oberlunnern, Kronau District, Zurich, Switzerland. He was baptized on 7 Dec 1645 at Ottenbach Reformed Church, Kronau District, Zurich, Switzerland. He died on 23 Feb 1706 at Ransbr
2 CONC unn, Zweibruecken, Germany. In 1661 he lived in Reichenweirer, Alsace and in 1670 we find him in the Palatinate. In 1677
2 CONT he was a tenant farmer and hofman in Ransbrun, (Rannsbrunnerhof = 6781 Eppenbrunn), Germany where his three oldest children were born between 1700-1708.
2 CONT An entry in the Rieschweiler Reformed KB where his son, Lorentz was baptised states that Rudolff Gutt was from Oberlunnern, SW. (Unterlunnern, ZH = CHH 8912 Obfelden.)
2 CONT He was also married to an Margaretha Jaggli before 1689. * Hans Rudolph GUTH Sr. and * Anna ZELLER were married in 1695 at Oberlunnern, Kronau District, Zurich, Switzerland.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT The notes confuse me!
