2 CONT * Daughter of Johann Melchior Frey and Catharina Burgester 
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: '''Hans Heinrich Funck''' in 1659 in Ober-Mettmenstetten, Mettmenstetten, Zürich, Switzerland.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Heinrich Hans Funck''' aka. Heinrich Manor Funk , birth: 1662 in Ober Mettmenstetten, Zürich, Switzerland or Kraichgau, Baden, , Germany, death: September 5, 1734  or October 8, 1735 in Strasburg Manor, Lancaster County, PA. 
2 CONC  Married: Verena Franey ~1687-88 in Germany
2 CONT * '''Martin Funck;''' birth: ~1670 in Palitinate,Germany, death: 1740 in PA
2 CONT * '''Heinrich Funck;''' birth: ~1675 in Germany, death: ~1743 in Lancaster County PA or Virginia.  Married: Elisabeth Hoover / Huber ~1675 in Germany
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.usfunks.net/genealogy/Funk/Research/Funck_Hans_Heinrich_Meyli_1639.htm FUNK FAMILY HISTORY]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Hans Heinrich Meyli Funck ~1639 - 1685 & Barbel Frey 1639-1681'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Hans Heinrich Meyli Funk Birth: 1639 in Ober Mettmenstetten, Zürich, Switzerland son of Heinrich "Heini" FUNCK (1611) and Katherine/Cathrine MEYLI (1612) Baptism: August 17, 1639 (or Sept 1, 1639) Mettmenstetten, Zürich & died i
2 CONC n 1685 in Schatthausen, Kraichgau Germand, Rheinland, Germany. Married: Barbara Hauberger Frey ~1659 in Mettmenstetten, Zürich, Switzerland. Barbara Hauberger Frey  (or Barbel Frey) Birth: 1639 in Ober Mettmenstetten, Zürich, Swit
2 CONC zerland. Death: 1681. Father:  Melchior Frey born October 27, 1611 in Baregg, Knonau, Zurich, Switzerland; died 1643. Mother: Catharina Burgester born 1619 in Switzerland Death:   after 1681 Father:  Melchoir Frey
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children:=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Heinrich Hans Funck, aka. Heinrich Manor Funk,''' Birth: 1662 in Ober Mettmenstetten, Zürich, Switzerland or Kraichgau, Baden, , Germany and died on September 5, 1734  or October 8, 1735 in Strasburg Manor, Lancaster County, 
2 CONC PA. Married: Verena Franey ~1687-88 in Germany
2 CONT * '''Martin Funck,''' Birth: ~1670 in Palitinate,Germany & died in 1740 in PA, USA
2 CONT * '''Heinrich Funck,''' Birth: ~1675 in Germany & died in 1743 in Lancaster County PA or Virginia. Married: Elisabeth Hoover / Huber ~1675 in Germany.
2 CONT * '''Samuel Funck,''' Birth: ~1680-81 in Palitinate,Germany & died in 1758 in Streichenberg, Kraichgau, Germany. 
