2 CONT
2 CONT Badine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 157.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mil Familias III by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 140 & 353.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of ISABEL DE URIBE-TREVINO and MIGUEL DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-RENTERIA are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. CAYETANA6 DE-LA-GARZA-URIBE.
2 CONT
2 CONT 45. ii. CLARA MARIA DE-LA-GARZA-URIBE.
2 CONT
