1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 4. FRANCISCA2 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO-RODRIGUEZ (JUAN-FRANCISCO1 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO) was born 1580, and died in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. She married CAPTAIN DOMINGO DE-LA-FUENTE. He was born Abt. 1578, and died
2 CONC  Aft. May 26, 1646 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for CAPTAIN DOMINGO DE-LA-FUENTE:
2 CONT
2 CONT Origen de los Fundadores de Texas, Muevo Mexico, Coahuila y Nuevo Leon, Saltillo Tomo II by
2 CONT
2 CONT Guillermo Garmendia Leal. Page 37.
2 CONT
2 CONT He signed his last will and testamen on May 26, 1646. Source: Mil Familias III.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of FRANCISCA MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO-RODRIGUEZ and DOMINGO DE-LA-FUENTE are:
2 CONT * i. ANA3 DE-LA-FUENTE.
2 CONT * ii. DOMINGO DE-LA-FUENTE, b. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; d. Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. MICALA DE-LA-CRUZ, Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. Marriage Notes for DOMINGO DE-LA-FUENTE and MICALA DE-LA-CRUZ: With All Arms, A Study of a Kindr
2 CONC ed Group, by Carl Laurence Duaine.
2 CONT * 15. iii. MARIA DE-LA-FUENTE-MARTINEZ.
2 CONT * iv. ESTRADA DE-LA-FUENTE.
2 CONT * v. MARIANA DE-LA-FUENTE.
2 CONT * 16. vi. JUANA DE-LA-FUENTE-MARTINEZ, b. Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico; d. Aft. April 09, 1683, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT * 17. vii. NICOLAS DE-LA-FUENTE, b. 1668, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT * 18. viii. JOSEPH DE-LA-FUENTES.
2 CONT * 19. ix. JOSEFA DEL VALLE, b. Monclova, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Francisca MARTINEZ was born (date unknown). Parents: Francisco MARTINEZ GUAJARDO and Ines (Ursula) Rodriguez NAVARRO (aka Ursula Catarina Navarro).
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Captain Domingo de la FUENTE. Francisca MARTINEZ and Captain Domingo de la FUENTE were married. Children were: Nicolas de la FUENTE, Juana de la FUENTE, Joseph de la FUENTE, Josepha de la FUENTE.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b155.html#P1039
2 CONT
2 CONT ======================================
2 CONT 4. FRANCISCA2 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO-RODRIGUEZ (JUAN-FRANCISCO1 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO) was born 1580, and died in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. She married CAPTAIN DOMINGO DE-LA-FUENTE. He was born Abt. 1578, and died Aft. May 26, 16
2 CONC 46 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for CAPTAIN DOMINGO DE-LA-FUENTE:
2 CONT
2 CONT Origen de los Fundadores de Texas, Muevo Mexico, Coahuila y Nuevo Leon, Saltillo Tomo II by
2 CONT
2 CONT Guillermo Garmendia Leal. Page 37.
2 CONT
2 CONT He signed his last will and testamen on May 26, 1646. Source: Mil Familias III.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of FRANCISCA MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO-RODRIGUEZ and DOMINGO DE-LA-FUENTE are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. ANA3 DE-LA-FUENTE.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. DOMINGO DE-LA-FUENTE, b. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; d. Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. MICALA DE-LA-CRUZ, Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for DOMINGO DE-LA-FUENTE and MICALA DE-LA-CRUZ:
2 CONT
2 CONT With All Arms, A Study of a Kindred Group, by Carl Laurence Duaine.
2 CONT
2 CONT 15. iii. MARIA DE-LA-FUENTE-MARTINEZ.
2 CONT
