2 CONT ======================
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Beatríz González Hidalgo Navarro''', born about 1597 at Monterrey, Nuevo León, New Spain, died 10 May, 1670 at Monterrey, Nuevo León, New Spain, she was buried at the Convento de San Francisco Javier, Monterrey, Nuevo León, New
2 CONC  Spain.
2 CONT
2 CONT Beatríz married:
2 CONT #Capitan Blas Maria de la Garza Falcon about 1615
2 CONT
