0 @N6000000005024502005@ NOTE Please note that this link is yet unsubstantiated. Evidence as to exactly which BETHANCOURT (BETTENCOURT, BETANCUR) line of which Maria Perez de BETANCUR is descendant has not been determined. However; it is certain that she is de
1 CONC scended from the BETANCUR's of the Canary Islands.
1 CONT I am told by Canary Islanders that this line exists on record, hopefully someone will be able to research the records and shed light on this line of BETANCUR's that extend into New Mexico.
1 CONT
1 CONT Based upon information available, this is the most likely link between Maria Perez de Betancur's family and the founding Betancur families of the Canary Islands. Again, this is not a definitive link, but a possible one. Perhaps it
1 CONC  will prompt other researchers to pursue this important area of New Mexico genealogical history.
