0 @N6000000005599062236@ NOTE Decendants of Blas and Rosa are listed on the Great New Mexico Surname Database and includes:
1 CONT
1 CONT - Ana Maria Martin- 1712, died 10 Nov 1803 in Los Luceros, NM.  She married Diego Lucero De Godoy on 3 Feb 1726 in San Juan DLC, NM and they had Joseph Miguel, Antonio, Santiago, Salvador Manuel, Nicolas and Gregorio Lucero De God
1 CONC oy.  Their decendants are also listed.
1 CONT - Pedro Martin Serrano- Abt 1712, died 12 May 1768 in Santa Clara, NM.  He married Margarita De San Juan Luna and their decendants are also listed.
1 CONT - Andres Martin was born about 1714 and died 11 Apr 1782 in Quemado, NM.  He married Lucia Pelaes on 2 Sep 1730 in San Juan DLC, NM.
1 CONT - Angela Martin- Abt 1716 marrried Paulin De Abeyta on 6 Jul 1737 in Santa Cruz DLC, NM and they had Juana De Abeyta and Maria Francisca Abeyta whose decendants are also listed.
1 CONT - Juan Martin- Was baptized 20 Oct 1714
1 CONT - Nicolas Martin- ABt 1720.  He married Geronima Pacheco and had Antonio Lucrecio, Jose Antonio, Rosalia and Jose Ignacio.  Their decendants are also listed.
1 CONT - Joseph Martin- Abt 1722, died 1784 in Ojo Caliente, NM.  He married Josefa Romero on 3 FEb 1745 in Albuquerque, NM.  They had Maria, Antonio Faustino, Antonio Jose, Maria, Gregoria Isadora, Feliciana, Maria De La Luz, Maria Cata
1 CONC lina, Merigildo Hermenigildo, and Maria De Las Niebes Martin.  Thier decendants are also listed.
1 CONT - Elena Martin -Abt 1724 married Juan Joseph Lovato in Jul 1796 in Taos, NM.
1 CONT - Antonio Martin- Abt 1726 and his decendants.
1 CONT - Andres Martin- Abt 1730 married Lucia Pelaes.
0 @N6000000005024488258@ NOTE Catholic
1 CONT Lazaro de Córdoba and others of the same name appear in land documents from 1712 to 1762, always in the Santa Cruz or Rio Arriba area. Although his wife was Ana Valdés as late as 1712, some children by a second wife appear several
1 CONC  years later, if the fahter is the same Lazaro. These were: Francisco Xavier, born on February 2, 1727, child of Lazaro de Córdoba and Petronila de Avila, and Germán, June 13, 1731, child of Lazaro de Córdoba and Petrona Martín.
